        <mxCell id="node_banner_hdr" value="V1.0 清爽版智能体编排拓扑图：主干有向推进 + 尾部受控有界环路 (Bounded Cyclic StateGraph)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#0F172A;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="32" y="24" width="2736" height="38" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="node_banner_body" value="说明：本图剥离冗长上下文载荷卡片，左侧主图严格呈现控制流骨架、Fan-Out/Join 并发与 Critic 受控闭环 (&lt;= 2 轮)；右侧独立附表集中展示图例约定、模型实证及 7 处 LLM Context 组装速查，与 A0 详图完全一致。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=13;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1">
