        <mxCell id="node_v1" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="336" width="980" height="126" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="node_v1_hdr" value="[V1 · 硬编码 Python] 双引擎 AI 检索入库 + PALMs 16 项财务预计算" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#1E3A8A;strokeColor=#1E3A8A;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="336" width="980" height="38" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="node_v1_body" value="• Metaso(CN) + Serper(GL) + r.jina.ai → SQLite EvidenceVault (225 条去重证据, 63.11% CN)。&#10;• tools/roi_calculator.py：确定性算出 16 项 CAPEX/Payback/IRR/NPV/TAM（严禁 LLM 心算）。&#10;• 执行序差异：模式1 (run_workflow) 因沙箱限网将本步前置到 Phase 1；模式2 (graph.py) 置于 V2 之后。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=13;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="374" width="980" height="88" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="node_v2" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#F5F3FF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="502" width="980" height="112" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="node_v2_hdr" value="[V2 · LLM #1] Step-Back 物理第一性原理总规划 (+ 可选 HITL 检查点)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#5B21B6;strokeColor=#5B21B6;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="502" width="980" height="38" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="node_v2_body" value="• 1× LLM 调用 (Context #1)：推演跨行业核心传感物理不变量与 8 赛道失效机理（不注网页噪音）。&#10;• 模式2 启用 --hitl 时在此调用 interrupt() 人工审阅后，再按 8 赛道并发扇出。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#1E1B4B;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=13;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="540" width="980" height="74" as="geometry" />
