        <mxCell id="node_v6_critic" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#FFF1F2;strokeColor=#E11D48;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="1432" width="980" height="126" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="node_v6_critic_hdr" value="[V6 · LLM #5 + 条件路由] 异构 Critic 审稿 &amp; route_after_critic" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#9F1239;strokeColor=#9F1239;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="1432" width="980" height="38" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="node_v6_critic_body" value="• 审查 Context #5 (实测首轮 pass, 置信度 98.5)；防死循环硬熔断：loop_count &lt;= max_loops (默认 2 轮)。&#10;• 三路条件分流：1) pass 向下直通终审 ｜ 2) needs_more_evidence 向右补搜重合成 ｜ 3) needs_rewrite 向左重写。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#4C0519;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=13;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="1470" width="980" height="88" as="geometry" />
